- WB | volunteer for her campaign at the next election | v: achievement, conformity | lever: loyalty | pushes: institution party | sphere: rule.WB | chance: 60
- WG | start a residents' group to look after it and share it with the next estate | v: benevolence, universalism | lever: found | pushes: group neighbours | sphere: rule.GW | chance: 60
works: The playground fills every afternoon, and {N} is glad of the part {N} played.
works: The estate learns it can ask and be heard, and {N} keeps asking.
fails: The library across town shuts its upper floor, and the quarrel over the money follows {N} home.
fails: When the councillor loses her seat, the playground's repairs stop, and nobody else will take them on.
